ll of the top room (y1) - searching upward from (11,2) or similar\n2. Bottom wall of the bottom room (y16) - searching downward from (15,15) or similar\n3. Left walls of the rooms - searching leftward\n4. Right wall of the right room - searching rightward\n\nLet me search at multiple positions. I'll start at (11,2) near the top wall.",
