ng into a losing fight, triggering a trap, wasting turns in a dead end. Costs one turn and no game time. n must be between 1 and 15.\n    \n    Arguments (JSON Schema):\n    {}\n\n\nHelp on function reveal in module rlm.mcp_base:\n\nasync reveal(**kwargs: 'Any') -> 'Any'\n    Reveal a rectangular region of the dungeon map as ASCII (for the bounding-box observation mode, where the map is otherwise hidden). Coordinates are map cells: x = column 0-78, y = row 0-20, inclusive. The FULL map (x1=0, y1=0, x2=78, y2=20) is a valid request and returns all 79 columns. Returns the sub-rectangle as text; consumes NO game turn. Out-of-range requests are clamped to the grid, and any clamping is stated in the reply.\n    \n    Arguments (JSON Schema):\n    {}\n\n\n",
